<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 2 T-bill issues for 3.37 bln levs.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 2 T-bill issues for 3.37 bln levs.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed two special issues of discount T-bills worth a total of 3.37 billion levs and yielding 12.99 and 4.66 percent to maturity, respectively, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say with which financial intitution or institutions the issues were placed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Prices in percent of par.</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3027597007	BG3027697007</p>
<p> Type			    discount	    discount</p>
<p> Term			    24 days	     10 days</p>
<p> Issue date		    April 8	     April 8</p>
<p> Maturity date		 May 2		 April 18</p>
<p> Par value		     2,540 million levs    830 million levs</p>
<p> Selling price		 88.50 pct	   95.55 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     12.99 pct	   4.66 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
